Inspect the existing Angular + Node implementation first, then implement these changes end-to-end without breaking current functionality or creating duplicate services/components.

1. Configuration – Save & Connect
On Configuration > Machine Paths, add a clear “Save & Connect” button.
- Detect unsaved changes and enable the button only when required.
- On click: validate inputs → save/persist configuration → show Saving/Saved state → automatically re-run connection health checks.
- Do not run health checks if save fails.
- Show useful field-level errors such as path not found/invalid executable where possible.
- Show final connection status after re-check.
