Fix Manage Project so it follows the globally selected repository.

When the user changes the repo from the top dropdown while already on Manage Project:
- detect selectedRepo change immediately
- clear stale repo state/actions
- show loading state
- load and render the newly selected repo without browser/hard reload
- temporarily prevent actions against the old repo
- show a clear error if the new repo cannot be loaded instead of leaving old data visible.

Also add a Refresh button on Manage Project.
Refresh must reload only the currently selected repo’s branch, status, change count, repo-dependent actions and relevant metadata.
It must not hard-reload the browser.

